<title>AUSTRALIA: All Ordinaries index climbs to new highs.</title>
<headline>All Ordinaries index climbs to new highs.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Stock Exchange's key barometer, the All Ordinaries index, climbed to a record high on Tuesday, gaining 11.6 points to 2406.3 by 10.20 a.m. (2320 GMT), following the surge to record highs on Wall Street.</p>
<p>The previous record high of 2406.2 was set on November 21, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
